; S3.9 — DATA opcode template table (20B rows; RET/NOP/SET)
; Sibling: s3_opcode_template_table.tyb (60B .data ≤64 mini cap)
; Honest: table in YOYO DATA; **lookup still Rust**. OW-RT CUT.
;
; Row = 20 bytes LE: op:u8, len:u8, pad:u16, bytes[16]
;   RET  0xFF len=1  C3
;   NOP  0x00 len=1  90
;   SET  0x30 len=14 movabs+store (slot0=0xDEADBEEF; no ret)
; Compose SET+RET / NOP+RET ≡ emit_x86
